# Title: Security Software Discovery - Linux
# ID: c9d8b7fd-78e4-44fe-88f6-599135d46d60
# Status: test
# Level: low
# Author: Daniil Yugoslavskiy, oscd.community
# Date: 2020-10-19
# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1518.001
# Description: Detects usage of system utilities (only grep and egrep for now) to discover security software discovery
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((process_name:*/grep OR process_name:*/egrep) AND (cmdline:*nessusd* OR cmdline:*td-agent* OR cmdline:*packetbeat* OR cmdline:*filebeat* OR cmdline:*auditbeat* OR cmdline:*osqueryd* OR cmdline:*cbagentd* OR cmdline:*falcond*))
